","a":"وَخَلَقَ","t":"and He (has) created","p":"V","tr":"wakhalaqa","f":["PERF","3MS"],"r":34,"l":60,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["خَلَقَ","V","stem","PERF|3MS"]]},{"i":"25:2:16","a":"كُلَّ","t":"every","p":"N","tr":"kulla","f":["M","ACC"],"r":16,"l":31},{"i":"25:2:17","a":"شَىْءٍۢ","t":"thing","p":"N","tr":"shayin","f":["M","INDEF","GEN"],"r":10,"l":41},{"i":"25:2:18","a":"فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","t":"and determined it","p":"V","tr":"faqaddarahu","f":["PERF","(II)","3MS"],"r":81,"l":600,"g":[["فَ","CONJ","prefix","f:CONJ"],["قَدَّرَ","V","stem","PERF|(II)|3MS"],["هُۥ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MS"]]},{"i":"25:2:19","a":"تَقْدِيرًۭا","t":"(with) determination","p":"N","tr":"taqdīran","f":["VN","(II)","M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":81,"l":1404},{"e":"٢","v":"25:2"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"24:62","t":"The believers are only those who believe in Allāh and His Messenger and, when they are [meeting] with him for a matter of common interest, do not depart until they have asked his permission. Indeed, those who ask your permission, [O Muḥammad] - those are the ones who believe in Allāh and His Messenger. So when they ask your permission due to something of their affairs, then give permission to whom you will among them and ask forgiveness for them of Allāh. Indeed, Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","j":18,"h":36,"s":24,"a":62,"sd":null},{"k":"24:63","t":"Do not make [your] calling of the Messenger among yourselves as the call of one of you to another. Already Allāh knows those of you who slip away, concealed by others. So let those beware who dissent from his [i.e., the Prophet's] order, lest fitnah strike them or a painful punishment.","j":18,"h":36,"s":24,"a":63,"sd":null},{"k":"24:64","t":"Unquestionably, to Allāh belongs whatever is in the heavens and earth. Already He knows that upon which you [stand] and [knows] the Day when they will be returned to Him and He will inform them of what they have done. And Allāh is Knowing of all things.","j":18,"h":36,"s":24,"a":64,"sd":null},{"k":"25:1","t":"Blessed is He who sent down the Criterion upon His Servant that he may be to the worlds a warner -","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"25:2","t":"He to whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth and who has not taken a son and has not had a partner in dominion and has created each thing and determined it with [precise] determination.","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":2,"sd":null}],"juz":18,"hizb":36,"surahs":[24,25],"sajdah":false}